{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-types","title":"代数数据类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/algebraic-types","wordCount":1151,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"代数数据类型\">代数数据类型</h1><p>为什么 Haskell 程序员能那么自信地说「编译通过基本就对了」？很大程度上靠代数数据类型（Algebraic Data Type, ADT）。它用两种极简的组合方式——「和」与「积」——就能精确地刻画领域里的数据形状，把不可能的状态从类型上彻底抹掉。这一篇是建模的起点，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/types-basics\">类型基础</a> 里 <code>Maybe</code>、<code>Either</code> 那些例子背后的统一原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「代数」二字不是装饰：ADT 的取值数量真的服从代数运算。积类型（product）把多个字段「与」在一起，取值数是各字段取值数之积；和类型（sum）把多个变体「或」在一起，取值数是各变体取值数之和。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[data 声明] --&gt; B[和类型 sum&lt;br/&gt;多个变体 用 &amp;vert;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[积类型 product&lt;br/&gt;单变体多字段]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;Bool = True &amp;vert; False&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 相加&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[Point = P Int Int&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 相乘]&#10;  B --&gt; F[模式匹配&lt;br/&gt;按变体解构]&#10;  C --&gt; F&#10;  A --&gt; G[递归类型&lt;br/&gt;List Tree]&#10;  F --&gt; H[穷尽性检查&lt;br/&gt;编译器警告漏分支]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[data 声明] --&gt; B[和类型 sum&lt;br/&gt;多个变体 用 &amp;vert;]\n  A --&gt; C[积类型 product&lt;br/&gt;单变体多字段]\n  B --&gt; D[\"Bool = True &amp;vert; False&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 相加\"]\n  C --&gt; E[Point = P Int Int&lt;br/&gt;取值数 = 相乘]\n  B --&gt; F[模式匹配&lt;br/&gt;按变体解构]\n  C --&gt; F\n  A --&gt; G[递归类型&lt;br/&gt;List Tree]\n  F --&gt; H[穷尽性检查&lt;br/&gt;编译器警告漏分支]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>这套「和与积」的代数恰好对应类型取值数的算术：积类型对应乘法，和类型对应加法。下面这张表把对应关系列清楚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代数运算</th>\n<th>类型构造</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>取值数公式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a+b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>和类型（多变体）</td>\n<td><code>Either A B</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert A\\rvert + \\lvert B\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\times b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>积类型（多字段）</td>\n<td><code>(A, B)</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert A\\rvert \\times \\lvert B\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（单位元）</td>\n<td>单值类型</td>\n<td><code>()</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（零元）</td>\n<td>无值类型</td>\n<td><code>Void</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可选</td>\n<td><code>Maybe A</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + \\lvert A\\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"积类型-把字段-与-在一起\">积类型：把字段「与」在一起</h2><p>积类型用一个构造器搭配多个字段，所有字段同时存在：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Point = Point Int Int            -- 一个构造器，两个字段&#10;&#10;data Person = Person&#10;  { name :: String                    -- 记录语法，带字段名&#10;  , age  :: Int&#10;  }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Point = Point Int Int            -- 一个构造器，两个字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data Person = Person</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  { name :: String                    -- 记录语法，带字段名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  , age  :: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>记录语法不仅给字段命名，还自动生成访问器（<code>name p</code>、<code>age p</code>）。<code>Person</code> 的取值数是 <code>String</code> 与 <code>Int</code> 取值数的乘积——这正是「积」的来由：每个 <code>name</code> 都可以配每个 <code>age</code>。积类型适合刻画「一个东西由若干部分共同构成」的概念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"和类型-把变体-或-在一起\">和类型：把变体「或」在一起</h2><p>和类型用 <code>|</code> 列出互斥的变体，一个值在任一时刻只属于其中一个：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Shape&#10;  = Circle Double            -- 半径&#10;  | Rectangle Double Double  -- 宽 高&#10;  | Triangle Double Double Double\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = Circle Double            -- 半径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Rectangle Double Double  -- 宽 高</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Triangle Double Double Double</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 Haskell 建模最有威力的地方。一个 <code>Shape</code> 要么是圆、要么是矩形、要么是三角，类型系统保证它不可能「既是圆又是矩形」，也不可能「什么都不是」。和类型让你把领域里的「互斥可能性」直接编码进类型，对照 OOP 里常用一堆布尔标志或 <code>null</code> 拼凑出的脆弱状态，高下立判。<code>Maybe a = Nothing | Just a</code> 和 <code>Either e a = Left e | Right a</code> 就是最常用的两个和类型，承接自 <a href=\"../foundations/types-basics\">类型基础</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模式匹配与穷尽性\">模式匹配与穷尽性</h2><p>ADT 的天然解构方式是模式匹配——按构造器拆开值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"area :: Shape -&gt; Double&#10;area (Circle r)        = pi * r * r&#10;area (Rectangle w h)   = w * h&#10;area (Triangle a b c)  = let s = (a+b+c)/2&#10;                         in sqrt (s*(s-a)*(s-b)*(s-c))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>area :: Shape -> Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Circle r)        = pi * r * r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Rectangle w h)   = w * h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>area (Triangle a b c)  = let s = (a+b+c)/2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                         in sqrt (s*(s-a)*(s-b)*(s-c))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键红利是穷尽性检查：若你漏写了某个变体的分支，GHC 在开启 <code>-Wincomplete-patterns</code>（实务里常用 <code>-Wall</code>）时会警告。这意味着每当你给和类型加一个新变体，编译器会逐一指出所有需要更新的匹配处——重构有了类型层面的「待办清单」。这种「编译器替你找漏」的体验，是 ADT 让大型程序可维护的核心原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"递归类型-自我指涉的数据\">递归类型：自我指涉的数据</h2><p>ADT 可以递归引用自身，于是链表、树这些结构能优雅定义：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)&#10;&#10;depth :: Tree a -&gt; Int&#10;depth Leaf         = 0&#10;depth (Node l _ r) = 1 + max (depth l) (depth r)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Tree a = Leaf | Node (Tree a) a (Tree a)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>depth :: Tree a -> Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>depth Leaf         = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>depth (Node l _ r) = 1 + max (depth l) (depth r)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Tree a</code> 在自己的定义里提到自己，配合 <a href=\"../foundations/purity-laziness\">纯度与惰性求值</a> 的惰性，甚至能定义无穷树而不立即展开。递归 ADT + 递归函数 + 模式匹配，构成 Haskell 处理结构化数据的标准三件套。这里的类型参数 <code>a</code> 也预告了下一篇 <a href=\"higher-kinded\">高阶类型</a>：<code>Tree</code> 本身不是完整类型，而是「接收一个类型才变成类型」的构造器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"让非法状态无法表达\">让非法状态无法表达</h2><p>ADT 的终极用法是设计——刻意让坏数据无从构造。比如一个网络连接，与其用 <code>Bool isConnected</code> 加一堆可能为 <code>null</code> 的字段，不如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"haskell\" data-code=\"data Connection&#10;  = Disconnected&#10;  | Connecting Host&#10;  | Connected Host Socket\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data Connection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  = Disconnected</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Connecting Host</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Connected Host Socket</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样「未连接却持有 socket」这种非法组合在类型上根本拼不出来。把状态机的合法转移编码进和类型，是 Haskell 工程里反复出现的高价值模式，也是「让非法状态无法表达」这句口号最朴素的兑现。把这套思路推到极致——把更多不变量抬进类型——就进入了 <a href=\"advanced-extensions\">高级类型扩展</a> 的领地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ADT 由「和」（多变体，互斥）与「积」（多字段，并存）两种组合构成，取值数服从加法与乘法。</li>\n<li>积类型刻画「由若干部分共同构成」，记录语法还自动生成字段访问器。</li>\n<li>和类型把领域里的互斥可能性编码进类型，<code>Maybe</code>/<code>Either</code> 是最常用实例。</li>\n<li>模式匹配按构造器解构，穷尽性检查让编译器替你列出重构待办，是可维护性的核心。</li>\n<li>递归 ADT 定义链表、树等结构，配合惰性可表达无穷结构。</li>\n<li>把状态机合法转移编码进和类型即「让非法状态无法表达」，推向 <a href=\"advanced-extensions\">高级类型扩展</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代数数据类型","id":"代数数据类型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"积类型：把字段「与」在一起","id":"积类型-把字段-与-在一起"},{"level":2,"text":"和类型：把变体「或」在一起","id":"和类型-把变体-或-在一起"},{"level":2,"text":"模式匹配与穷尽性","id":"模式匹配与穷尽性"},{"level":2,"text":"递归类型：自我指涉的数据","id":"递归类型-自我指涉的数据"},{"level":2,"text":"让非法状态无法表达","id":"让非法状态无法表达"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Monad 单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/abstractions/monads"},"next":{"title":"高阶类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/haskell-pure-functional/type-system/higher-kinded"}}